er||4|93||bib6|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5346480</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Coyle</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Small</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Ashworth</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hennessy</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Jenkins-Clarke</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Mannion</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Rice</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahmedzai</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Costs of palliative care in the community, in hospitals and in hospices in the UK</article-title><source>Crit Rev Oncol Hematol</source><year>1999</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>71</fpage><lpage>85</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Crit Rev Oncol Hematol||32|71||bib7|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10612007</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Department of Health</collab></person-group><article-title/><year>2003</year><publisher-name>London, UK</publisher-name>Reference costs</citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Early Breast Cancer Trialists' Collaborative Group</collab></person-group><article-title>Tamoxifen for early breast cancer: an overview of the randomised trials</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1998</year><volume>351</volume><fpage>1451</fpage><lpage>1467</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet||351|1451||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9605801</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Early Breast Cancer Trialists' Group</collab></person-group><article-title>Effects of chemothe